{"overview":"داستان مادر بهار که با شور و شوق وزن و عشق دو فرزند را در دل خود حمل می‌کند؛ بهار که در هشت سالگی توسط مادرش رها شد، بعدها مادربزرگ و پدرش را از دست داد. وقتی فکر می‌کند تنهاست، با سارپ آشنا می‌شود و به‌دقت به او دل می‌بندد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The story of mother Bahar, who carries the weight and love of two children in their hearts with enthusiasm in their hearts. Bahar, abandoned by her mother when she was eight years old, later lost her grandma and her father. When she thinks she is all alone, she meets Sarp, whom she delicately loves.","tagline_en":"","runtime":120,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":32,"y":2017,"poster":"/nGW4STJLVazkq41RcFa7kGe12qI.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":32,"y":2018,"poster":"/Aq95yoHPOw7gdwb6DWzmKh91M30.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":17,"y":2019,"poster":"/olNVxSzpwxdc90L9o77XqcFtQE5.jpg"}],"episodes":81,"crew":["Merve Girgin","Nadim Güç","Hande Altaylı"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR","US","MX"],"cast":[{"name":"Özge Özpirinçci","role":"Bahar Çeşmeli","photo":"/rK2dBTuuJTHmanaBOtT4FXouDii.jpg"},{"name":"Caner Cindoruk","role":"Sarp Çeşmeli","photo":"/nZ2BkGLDGBReXXRzN8xf2wc9dQa.jpg"},{"name":"Bennu Yıldırımlar","role":"Hatice Sarıkadı","photo":"/pMY0AsgxHZXxcXwAonM8C5dV1j5.jpg"},{"name":"Seray Kaya","role":"Şirin Sarıkadı","photo":"/vonxi1y7pUDcbeOantOqYrBSizx.jpg"},{"name":"Ece Özdikici","role":"Jale Demir","photo":"/by1sxm78jwvs02NttK1JCYVi5qC.jpg"},{"name":"Devrim Özder Akın","role":"Musa Demir","photo":"/1DmZenlJJ6B25Di0S5bjvSW4l7X.jpg"},{"name":"Feyyaz Duman","role":"Arif","photo":"/58HoLp9QEziXxOzAz32sNvyn3yC.jpg"},{"name":"Gökçe Eyüboğlu","role":"Ceyda","photo":"/i38PVEGnBZ42WY2H5EjlFk2aP08.jpg"},{"name":"Ayça Erturan","role":"Yeliz Ünsal","photo":"/o6olVIU2PzyZEjyRNuTLIJdGYg7.jpg"},{"name":"Ceyda Ateş","role":"","photo":"/iBwVznsVdbv7SrXcHuRoq6KXUCR.jpg"},{"name":"Yaşar Üzer","role":"Arif'in Babası","photo":"/eGLck2ilnlpjUW0s26IWQpZ8CaH.jpg"},{"name":"Şerif Erol","role":"Enver Sar